{"title":"Britain’s productivity problem","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/916412606/0/marginalrevolution~Britains-productivity-problem.html","date":1744183214000,"content":"<p>A big chunk of it is coming from the health care sector.  Information and communications are not growing in productivity as rapidly as before, and Britain has done less well boosting productivity with tech and also in oil and gas extraction.  Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/simonpittaway/status/1909515435264860310?s=46&amp;t=fSypFxt84bBHId-do9r5Ag\" target=\"_blank\">the thread</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.resolutionfoundation.org/publications/yanked-away/\" target=\"_blank\">the underlying study from the Resolution Foundation</a>.  This is important work.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/04/britains-productivity-problem.html\">Britain’s productivity problem</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/916412606/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/916412606/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/916412606/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/916412606/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/916412606/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/916412606/marg